><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-document-publisher-access-provider.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>grp-003 A request without a token is refused</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-003 (input bindings and expected data). Covers security.authorization.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>grp-004 A token with no usable scope is refused</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-004 (input bindings and expected data). Covers security.scope.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>3 Suite: Find Document References [ITI-67]</b></p><p>Rule: Find Document References [ITI-67] — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-document-publisher-access-provider.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>grp-005 Search by patient returns a searchset of conformant DocumentReferences</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-005 (input bindings and expected data). Covers DocumentReference.search-type.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>grp-006 Search by EEHRxF priority category</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-006 (input bindings and expected data). Covers DocumentReference.search-type.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>grp-007 Search by LOINC document type</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-007 (input bindings and expected data). Covers DocumentReference.search-type.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>grp-008 Read a DocumentReference by id</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-008 (input bindings and expected data). Covers DocumentReference.read.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>grp-009 An unknown DocumentReference id gives 404 and an OperationOutcome</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-009 (input bindings and expected data). Covers DocumentReference.read.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>4 Suite: Retrieve Document [ITI-68]</b></p><p>Rule: Retrieve Document [ITI-68] — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-document-publisher-access-provider.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>grp-010 Read the document content as a Binary</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-010 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Binary.read.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>5 Suite: Patient lookup (PDQm ITI-78) is available when the server offers it</b></p><p>Rule: Patient lookup (PDQm ITI-78) is available when the server offers it — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-document-publisher-access-provider.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>grp-011 Search Patient by identifier</td><td>Patient is SHOULD on the Access Provider: a server that does not offer it answers 404 or 501 and these scenarios are not applicable to it. A server that does offer it SHALL support all of the search parameters below. Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-011 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Patient.read, Patient.search-type, Patient.search.identifier.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>grp-012 Read Patient by id and conform to patient-eu-core</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-012 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Patient.read, Patient.search.id.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>grp-013 Search Patient by demographics the reference patient has</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.grp-013 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Patient.search.family, Patient.search.given, Patient.search.birthdate, Patient.search.gender.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
